WEBVTT

00:02.140 --> 00:03.480
I see.

00:03.910 --> 00:07.440
I believe Executioners 
typically operate in pairs.

00:07.440 --> 00:11.400
Given that his partner hasn't appeared, 
he doesn't seem to be lying.

00:11.940 --> 00:15.870
Make them hurt so bad that 
they wish they'd never been born.

00:16.400 --> 00:17.830
Understood.

00:21.790 --> 00:24.040
You'll look out for me, right?

00:24.480 --> 00:26.150
Yes, of course.

00:26.150 --> 00:29.500
We can guard you like a precious gem.

00:33.040 --> 00:38.790
But we'd also welcome your help, 
if you should feel so inclined.

02:11.520 --> 02:17.400
Origin Witch

02:20.280 --> 02:21.450
Hey.

02:21.450 --> 02:22.370
Hm?

02:22.370 --> 02:27.620
I missed my chance to ask earlier, 
but did I have my precious first kiss with...

02:36.470 --> 02:37.180
Huh?

02:37.710 --> 02:39.520
Was there always a door here?

02:39.520 --> 02:42.030
No. Not until just now.

02:42.470 --> 02:44.920
But never mind that. You were saying?

02:44.920 --> 02:48.060
Never mind. I'd rather not know.

02:48.620 --> 02:55.200
So what is this place? The infamous 
Order of Magical Resonance's HQ?

02:55.200 --> 02:57.990
No way, right? It's way too small.

02:58.200 --> 03:00.240
You're right. It isn't.

03:00.240 --> 03:03.210
For starters, we don't have a headquarters.

03:03.210 --> 03:05.910
At least, not one that anyone knows about.

03:05.910 --> 03:08.130
This is an entrance to the Corridors.

03:08.640 --> 03:14.310
Helga, this route is just for us, 
so that I can escort you safe and sound.

03:15.000 --> 03:16.200
Huh.

03:17.340 --> 03:19.510
Anyway, I'll be right back.

03:19.510 --> 03:21.930
Be good and wait here, Guideau.

03:23.280 --> 03:26.930
Patch me up. Moving like 
this is a pain in the ass.

03:26.930 --> 03:28.350
You'll only be waiting.

03:28.820 --> 03:30.940
Why do you need to move?

03:40.200 --> 03:42.240
Are you sure about leaving her behind?

03:42.240 --> 03:45.970
Yes. The Order demands 
confidentiality on several points.

03:45.970 --> 03:50.330
I know you agreed to a magical 
contract to keep our secrets,

03:50.330 --> 03:52.190
but Guideau refused.

03:52.190 --> 03:54.920
As such, the Order's inner 
workings remain off-limits.

03:54.920 --> 03:57.250
All the more reason not to risk leaving her.

03:57.600 --> 04:00.520
I can't see her sitting tight 
and staying out of trouble.

04:00.520 --> 04:01.810
Don't worry.

04:01.810 --> 04:05.890
Following the mission and my orders is the shortest path to Guideau's goal,

04:05.890 --> 04:08.220
and Guideau knows it.

04:08.480 --> 04:09.730
Really?

04:09.730 --> 04:12.380
My partner is more rational 
than you might think.

04:12.380 --> 04:14.690
We shouldn't need to worry 
about pointless mischief.

04:15.600 --> 04:20.140
Then again, Guideau has been known 
to act on instinct despite knowing better.

04:20.520 --> 04:23.530
A few exceptions fall into that category,

04:23.530 --> 04:28.680
but I hardly expect one to turn up
 in a country town like this.

04:31.500 --> 04:32.910
A witch!

04:33.200 --> 04:35.220
I saw her! I saw her! A witch!

04:35.220 --> 04:36.370
For real?

04:37.750 --> 04:40.380
Yeah! I saw her brewing some kinda potion.

04:40.380 --> 04:43.340
She's really there! 
A witch with a big cauldron!

04:43.340 --> 04:46.140
She's brewing up poisons to curse people!

04:46.140 --> 04:49.420
See? What did I tell you?

04:49.420 --> 04:51.200
And you didn't believe me!

04:51.200 --> 04:52.890
Yeah. That was our bad.

04:53.360 --> 04:55.260
So what do we do now?

04:55.260 --> 04:57.790
The grown-ups won't 
believe us if we tell them.

04:57.790 --> 04:59.770
We'll have to get her ourselves.

04:59.770 --> 05:00.560
Hey!

05:00.560 --> 05:01.480
Huh?

05:03.250 --> 05:04.720
Did you hear something?

05:05.420 --> 05:06.570
Hey, look!

05:10.490 --> 05:11.920
Wh-What the...

05:11.920 --> 05:12.870
Where?

05:12.870 --> 05:13.750
Huh?

05:14.400 --> 05:17.750
Where's the witch? Take me to her.

05:18.050 --> 05:19.880
What?! Where'd you come from?!

05:19.880 --> 05:21.000
You're not making sense!

05:23.630 --> 05:26.910
What a pain. I'll kill you one at a time.

05:26.910 --> 05:29.510
Make up your minds before 
there's only one of you left.

05:31.940 --> 05:34.850
W-We'll do it. We'll take you to her.

05:48.610 --> 05:50.660
Uh, this is the place.

05:57.430 --> 06:00.330
Huh? Y-You're going in? It's not safe!

06:09.480 --> 06:13.640
Oh? What charming little visitors.

06:18.880 --> 06:20.900
Oh, goodness gracious.

06:21.640 --> 06:22.560
What the hell?

06:22.850 --> 06:24.530
It won't move!

06:24.530 --> 06:28.650
Your leg froze up? That's serious.

06:28.650 --> 06:30.980
I'd better put it right for you.

06:36.120 --> 06:38.300
Hey! What's your problem?!
 Get out of my way!

06:39.470 --> 06:41.580
Now my left arm's busted, too?

06:41.580 --> 06:43.600
Hey, now. Stop that.

06:43.600 --> 06:45.650
Injured people need care.

06:49.380 --> 06:51.760
No need to act so skittish.

06:51.760 --> 06:55.600
Customers love this ointment. 
It's my secret recipe.

06:55.600 --> 06:57.100
Dear me.

06:58.150 --> 07:00.780
You certainly heal quickly.

07:01.320 --> 07:02.980
This smell...

07:02.980 --> 07:06.780
You're not a witch, are you?

07:12.300 --> 07:15.450
Welcome back. 
Will you be using the Corridors?

07:15.740 --> 07:18.080
Yes, I'd like to.

07:18.080 --> 07:20.160
Where do these connect to?

07:20.160 --> 07:26.300
We're in contact with 
rooms 5010, 6288, and 7006.

07:26.770 --> 07:29.150
And room 7006 would be?

07:29.150 --> 07:31.010
On the Sixth Continent, sir.

07:31.250 --> 07:33.270
Yes, that will do nicely.

07:34.620 --> 07:37.860
I have no clue what you're talking about.

07:37.860 --> 07:40.140
This will make sense to me one day, right?

07:40.140 --> 07:44.500
Of course. And unlike Guideau, 
I'm happy to say you'll be worth teaching.

07:44.750 --> 07:48.820
Mr. Ashaf, this just arrived for you.

07:49.980 --> 07:50.780
<i>Black...</i>

07:55.320 --> 07:56.200
What's that?

07:58.010 --> 08:00.970
Excuse me. Wait here for a moment.

08:00.970 --> 08:01.660
Huh?

08:02.210 --> 08:02.920
Hey!

08:03.690 --> 08:04.780
What's wrong?

08:08.990 --> 08:12.550
Now, listen here. I do use magic,

08:12.550 --> 08:15.840
but I'm still only a humble herbalist.

08:15.840 --> 08:20.680
Calling me a witch is an insult to witches.

08:20.680 --> 08:21.810
We're sorry.

08:22.090 --> 08:24.380
This is so heavy. Hold it for me.

08:24.380 --> 08:25.900
Do your fair share.

08:26.320 --> 08:30.320
Your silly stories got us 
into this mess, remember?

08:34.260 --> 08:35.280
Oh?

08:37.100 --> 08:40.950
My, my. So many visitors today.

08:40.950 --> 08:43.910
Hey, where the hell did you come from?

08:44.300 --> 08:47.130
I didn't sense you till the door opened.

08:47.470 --> 08:48.340
Huh?

08:54.160 --> 08:55.140
You're...

08:55.960 --> 08:57.360
an Executioner!

09:15.920 --> 09:18.060
You must be wondering where we are.

09:20.220 --> 09:22.520
This is my private world.

09:23.230 --> 09:26.860
An alternate dimension reached 
by passing inside this cloak.

09:27.830 --> 09:32.670
You can't even perceive it 
unless you have the cloak on.

09:33.260 --> 09:37.760
Your senses don't function.
 I doubt you can even think clearly.

09:38.370 --> 09:40.440
But you're special.

09:41.360 --> 09:43.750
I'll allow you a bit of freedom.

09:45.210 --> 09:47.080
I have questions for you.

09:48.910 --> 09:53.830
Executioners work in pairs.
 I have a partner.

09:54.360 --> 09:59.740
He started acting strangely, 
so I followed him.

09:59.740 --> 10:02.100
But I suppose I caught on too late.

10:02.610 --> 10:06.250
By the time I arrived, 
everything seemed to be over.

10:08.710 --> 10:11.600
You stayed at the scene, so I shadowed you.

10:11.600 --> 10:12.840
But what a surprise.

10:13.860 --> 10:17.940
I could never have managed it 
without this Forbidden Instrument,

10:17.940 --> 10:20.100
which lets me vanish from the world.

10:20.960 --> 10:23.560
The Order of Magical Resonance 
lives up to its reputation.

10:24.720 --> 10:29.440
Now you see where you stand.
 On to business.

10:29.760 --> 10:32.940
I have two questions for you,
 both quite simple.

10:34.240 --> 10:38.070
Where is my little brother 
and his Forbidden Instrument?

10:43.570 --> 10:45.580
Hey, are you done now?

10:47.400 --> 10:50.420
I'd like to chat with this little one, too.

10:58.460 --> 10:59.460
Ashaf!

10:59.730 --> 11:00.680
Ashaf!

11:00.990 --> 11:04.140
What happened? What could
have rattled you this badly?

11:04.560 --> 11:07.100
Yes, I'm rattled, all right.

11:07.410 --> 11:09.740
There's a witch in this city.

11:10.550 --> 11:12.770
And not just any witch.

11:13.440 --> 11:16.190
The "hateful witch" who cursed Guideau.

11:17.340 --> 11:18.810
Her name is...

11:26.250 --> 11:29.420
Angela!

11:38.800 --> 11:40.470
You bitch!

11:42.670 --> 11:44.100
Long time no see.

11:44.100 --> 11:45.390
I've missed you.

11:45.920 --> 11:49.020
Since this space isn't affecting you,

11:49.360 --> 11:52.450
that cloak must be more 
than a fashion statement.

11:52.450 --> 11:55.360
I thought mine was one of a kind.

11:55.810 --> 11:58.820
Oh, this? I made one just like yours.

12:00.000 --> 12:02.030
Nice, right? It comes in handy.

12:02.030 --> 12:04.250
<i>Does she mean she copied it?!</i>

12:04.250 --> 12:07.740
<i>This is no mere magical bauble.
 It's a Forbidden Instrument!</i>

12:07.740 --> 12:12.830
<i>And she recreated it, 
function and all, just by looking at it?!</i>

12:14.000 --> 12:18.270
But the ones I make wear out in no time.

12:19.250 --> 12:21.720
So, if you wouldn't mind...

12:22.030 --> 12:23.680
give me yours.

12:33.060 --> 12:34.900
<i>Impossible! How is she standing?!</i>

12:35.690 --> 12:40.340
<i>I only granted this woman 
minimal sight and hearing.</i>

12:40.340 --> 12:43.280
<i>She's been deprived
 of all her other senses!</i>

12:43.850 --> 12:45.510
<i>So how?!</i>

12:46.160 --> 12:48.070
<i>They're both freaks!</i>

12:52.300 --> 12:53.600
Can you get in touch?

12:53.600 --> 12:58.250
No, unfortunately. What rotten timing.

12:58.550 --> 13:02.270
But even if I could, it wouldn't help.

13:02.270 --> 13:04.720
It's too late for that.

13:06.050 --> 13:08.300
The thread is already pulling.

13:08.640 --> 13:11.010
What? What are you talking about?

13:11.310 --> 13:14.680
A force that pulls people together.

13:15.520 --> 13:21.570
The cursed and the curser 
develop a special type of bond.

13:21.570 --> 13:25.900
Those threads of fate 
draw them to each other.

13:26.180 --> 13:29.100
We call that the threads' pull.

13:29.100 --> 13:34.500
While their power is in play, 
I won't find it so easy to intervene.

13:35.540 --> 13:37.710
In any case, this doesn't look good.

13:38.080 --> 13:42.740
When I healed Guideau's body,
 I left it fragile in places, just in case,

13:42.740 --> 13:44.670
so the kid couldn't cause any trouble.

13:44.670 --> 13:50.140
Of course, even in perfect health, 
Guideau wouldn't stand a chance against her.

13:50.470 --> 13:53.100
But in this condition, 
even escape will prove difficult.

13:53.100 --> 13:56.810
Not that Guideau would ever 
try to run from her in any case.

13:56.810 --> 13:58.690
H-Hang on! Calm down!

14:04.400 --> 14:07.810
I'm quite calm. I sent out crows.

14:07.810 --> 14:09.820
Flailing blindly will get us nowhere.

14:10.310 --> 14:12.920
Regardless, you should go back inside.

14:12.920 --> 14:15.000
Why? I'll help you look.

14:15.000 --> 14:17.760
I've been entrusted with your safety.

14:17.760 --> 14:21.300
And this is Guideau's problem. 
I can't drag you into it.

14:22.000 --> 14:25.420
But I owe you two for saving me.

14:25.420 --> 14:28.470
I've gotta take you with me,
 or I've wasted my time!

14:29.360 --> 14:31.390
Then rescue me.

14:32.240 --> 14:36.640
If bringing me back is your job,
 keep the Demon Sword safe!

14:36.890 --> 14:39.110
Come back and rescue me!

14:40.720 --> 14:42.590
So just this once,

14:42.590 --> 14:44.980
Guideau's problem is my problem.

14:45.670 --> 14:48.360
She means a lot to you, right?

14:51.280 --> 14:53.660
Yes, a great deal.

14:54.640 --> 14:56.850
Far more than my own life.

15:03.770 --> 15:06.140
Funny, isn't it?

15:06.930 --> 15:12.590
I wanted to see you, 
but not that guy who's always with you.

15:13.030 --> 15:15.140
So I hid in this town,

15:15.140 --> 15:19.310
and spread rumors the Church, the Order, 
and the townsfolk would brush off.

15:20.230 --> 15:24.610
Rumors only you would 
take seriously, Guideau.

15:24.980 --> 15:27.650
Just a few tall tales.

15:28.150 --> 15:31.820
And look how perfectly that little 
bit of scheming worked out.

15:32.090 --> 15:36.160
We can see each other anytime, 
as long as we both feel like it.

15:36.160 --> 15:38.320
Fate's handy that way.

15:40.160 --> 15:41.370
So, Guideau...

15:41.790 --> 15:44.450
How does it feel, using my body?

15:45.490 --> 15:48.630
A witch's flesh is all about adaptability,

15:48.630 --> 15:54.220
so I bet it adjusted to your soul 
and made things a lot easier for you.

15:56.400 --> 15:58.680
Hands off.

15:59.200 --> 16:03.440
You don't like being touched? Even though 
you have no problem throwing punches?

16:04.610 --> 16:05.890
Talk about picky.

16:27.220 --> 16:29.060
You look so upset.

16:29.840 --> 16:31.390
Do you hate me?

16:32.590 --> 16:36.710
You know, I was playing with 
someone else until recently,

16:36.710 --> 16:38.290
but maybe I got bored.

16:38.790 --> 16:41.380
It just wasn't much fun anymore.

16:42.430 --> 16:43.600
Tell me, Guideau...

16:44.070 --> 16:47.560
Is it about time we went at it for real?

16:55.870 --> 16:57.600
That was a close one.

16:57.600 --> 16:59.700
You were going for a kiss, right?

17:00.020 --> 17:03.020
Wow. So you know about that trick.

17:03.550 --> 17:04.540
But no.

17:04.960 --> 17:08.450
If you really want to undo 
my curse, that isn't the way,

17:08.450 --> 17:09.810
and this isn't the time.

17:12.030 --> 17:13.560
Chase me, Guideau.

17:14.030 --> 17:15.900
I'll give you signposts.

17:16.450 --> 17:19.040
If you reach them all and catch up to me,

17:19.040 --> 17:21.310
I'll live up to your expectations, too.

17:21.670 --> 17:25.980
I forget how many decades it's been, 
but let's pick up where we left off that day.

17:29.200 --> 17:32.060
The Order must have caught on by now.

17:32.570 --> 17:35.700
Oh, right. They can't 
find me while I have this.

17:36.080 --> 17:37.780
What a lucky find.

17:41.810 --> 17:43.750
I mean, seriously...

17:44.270 --> 17:46.480
You just never break, do you?

17:47.640 --> 17:50.090
I swear, Angela...

17:50.690 --> 17:54.870
I'll kill you if it's the last thing I do!

17:55.500 --> 17:57.980
I like that look in your eyes.

18:11.050 --> 18:11.850
Guideau!

18:15.000 --> 18:16.980
Still breathing. Nothing to worry about.

18:16.980 --> 18:19.780
You call that "nothing"? 
She's hanging on by a thread.

18:19.780 --> 18:22.790
As long as Guideau's breathing, 
the rest works itself out.

18:23.370 --> 18:24.330
Hey, what's that?

18:29.170 --> 18:30.650
An Executioner!

18:31.130 --> 18:33.920
We weren't gone long, 
and I don't see any sign of a struggle.

18:34.210 --> 18:35.170
Angela...

18:35.670 --> 18:38.130
Who in the world is that witch?

18:39.780 --> 18:42.540
A celebrity. You've heard of her, too.

18:43.920 --> 18:47.890
Angela the Origin Witch. 
That should be all you need to hear.

18:48.170 --> 18:49.510
No way!

18:49.510 --> 18:51.560
You mean <i>the</i> Angela?!

18:51.870 --> 18:54.730
That can't be right! 
There's no way she could still be alive!

18:55.270 --> 18:58.400
Witches are destined to 
only live for 200 years!

18:58.890 --> 19:00.780
Oh, she's alive, all right.

19:01.840 --> 19:05.120
The "Eternal Witch," Angela Anne Huell,

19:05.700 --> 19:08.400
one of the world's most powerful witches,

19:08.400 --> 19:11.830
continues to live on in it to this very day.

19:11.830 --> 19:17.020
If that's true, Guideau chose one 
hell of a person to pick a fight with.

19:17.020 --> 19:18.600
You said it.

19:20.650 --> 19:25.140
I suppose it was Angela 
who carved those letters.

19:25.780 --> 19:26.470
I see.

19:27.510 --> 19:30.140
So it begins at last.

19:39.510 --> 19:41.530
Guideau, are you awake?

19:43.460 --> 19:44.500
I'm coming in.

19:51.010 --> 19:53.670
Did you find her?

19:53.670 --> 19:56.370
No, can't say I have.

19:56.370 --> 19:57.710
Then get lost.

19:58.180 --> 20:00.820
Why won't you touch your food?

20:00.820 --> 20:02.910
Just look at you, still covered in wounds.

20:03.360 --> 20:08.140
You eat and you heal, remember? 
How could you starve yourself all this time?

20:08.680 --> 20:11.470
If you won't eat, at least let me treat you.

20:11.470 --> 20:12.600
Give me a look.

20:13.490 --> 20:16.060
What kind of crap are 
you gonna pull this time?

20:18.040 --> 20:21.900
Back there, my arm and leg gave out on me...

20:26.320 --> 20:29.260
because you did something 
to them, didn't you?

20:29.740 --> 20:31.040
Stop, Guideau.

20:46.640 --> 20:48.790
You seem full of energy.

20:49.200 --> 20:51.850
I guess you won't need healing.

20:53.120 --> 20:54.810
You won't get another chance.

20:55.360 --> 20:58.880
Try it again, and I won't wait 
to undo the curse to kill you.

20:59.410 --> 21:01.150
I'm sorry.

21:01.150 --> 21:06.160
But I had no intention 
of setting you up to fail.

21:06.500 --> 21:10.580
I'm doing my best to 
assure things go smoothly.

21:11.020 --> 21:16.170
Nothing I do is pointless, and I won't 
do anything against your interests.

21:16.580 --> 21:18.880
You're a valuable human resource.

21:18.880 --> 21:23.970
I would never do anything 
that might result in losing you.

21:25.310 --> 21:28.690
You understand that our interests align.

21:28.690 --> 21:32.100
That's why you've obeyed my orders.

21:32.580 --> 21:36.060
When you suspect I'm "pulling 
something" in spite of that,

21:36.410 --> 21:39.750
I'm only doing so for the sake
 of the larger picture.

21:40.440 --> 21:42.440
Let me repeat myself:

21:42.440 --> 21:47.630
I'm not your enemy, 
and I won't do anything to harm you.

21:47.630 --> 21:50.450
I don't need your faith or trust.

21:51.000 --> 21:55.410
For now, just understand that with your head.

21:59.780 --> 22:01.200
Get out already.

22:01.200 --> 22:03.960
Oh, I can't go anywhere until I heal up.

22:04.430 --> 22:06.260
I have broken bones, you know.

22:08.730 --> 22:10.780
Oh, that smarts.

22:11.190 --> 22:14.300
Dear me, what a mess you've made.

22:18.120 --> 22:19.600
This takes me back.

22:21.540 --> 22:25.660
To three years ago, when we first met.

24:00.980 --> 24:05.160
Lady Witch, would you return 
to the Order with me?

24:05.970 --> 24:09.920
Next time: "Eloquence 
and Silence: Opening Act."

24:06.540 --> 24:09.920
Eloquence and Silence

24:06.540 --> 24:09.920
Opening Act
